{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19177","headline":"酬乐天贻贺金紫之什 · 刘禹锡","name":"酬乐天贻贺金紫之什","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"久学文章含白凤，却因政事赐金鱼。\n郡人未识闻谣咏，天子知名与诏书。\n珍重贺诗呈锦绣，愿言归计竝园庐。\n旧来词客多无位，金紫同游谁得如。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19177.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19177","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}